udarme, por favor?"}, "dansk": {"word": "kunne", "forms": "", "pron": "kúne", "ipa": "/ˈkunə/", "ex": "Kunne du hjælpe mig, tak?", "ex_es": "¿Podrías ayudarme, por favor?"}}}, {"es": "hacer", "img": null, "level": "A1", "pos": "verb", "l": {"english": {"word": "do", "forms": "did, done", "pron": "duu", "ipa": "/duː/", "ex": "I do my homework after dinner.", "ex_es": "Hago los deberes después de cenar."}, "français": {"word": "faire", "forms": "je fais, fait", "pron": "fer", "ipa": "/fɛʁ/", "ex": "Qu'est-ce que tu fais ce week-end ?", "ex_es": "¿Qué haces este fin de semana?"}, "dansk": {"word": "at gøre", "forms": "gør, gjorde, gjort", "pron": "göre", "ipa": "/ˈgœːɐ/", "ex": "Hvad skal vi gøre nu?", "ex_es": "¿Qué hacemos ahora?"}}}, {"es": "encontrar", "img": "img/om_1F50D.png", "level": "A1", "pos": "verb", "l": {"english": {"word": "find", "forms": "found, found", "pron": "fáind", "ipa": "/faɪnd/", "ex": "I can't find my phone anywhere.", "ex_es": "No encuentro el móvil por ningún sitio."}, "français": {"word": "trouver", "forms": "je trouve, trouvé", "pron": "truvé", "ipa": "/tʁuve/", "ex": "Je ne trouve pas mes clés.", "ex_es": "No encuentro mis llaves."}, "dansk": {"word": "at finde", "forms": "finder, fandt, fundet", "pron": "féne", "ipa": "/ˈfenə/", "ex": "Jeg kan ikke finde mine nøgler.", "ex_es": "No encuentro mis llaves."}}}, {"es": "conseguir, obtener, llegar", "img": null, "level": "A1", "pos": "verb", "l": {"english": {"word": "get", "forms": "got, got", "pron": "guet", "ipa": "/ɡet/", "ex": "Where did you get that jacket?", "ex_es": "¿Dónde conseguiste esa chaqueta?"}, "français": {"word": "obtenir", "forms": "j'obtiens, obtenu", "pron": "obtenír", "ipa": "/ɔptəniʁ/", "ex": "Il a obtenu son permis de conduire.", "ex_es": "Ha conseguido el carné de conducir."}, "dansk": {"word": "at få", "forms": "får, fik, fået", "pron": "fo", "ipa": "/ˈfɔˀ/", "ex": "Jeg fik en gave af min mor.", "ex_es": "Recibí un regalo de mi madre."}}}, {"es": "dar", "img": null, 